    "text": "Fluix has a mobile app that your team can use while they are away from the office. This is useful for inspections on site and for reporting information in real time. Team members can update information quickly and share it with others straight away. This helps everyone stay informed and work together more easily. It also means that people can respond to safety problems faster.",
